{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-driven romance simulation, you\u2019ll play as Broken \u2014 a rich girl who struck oil in her own backyard and stumbled into sudden wealth, only to be sent to a prestigious Finance Academy after spectacular investment failures and a complete meltdown of her money sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission?<br>Simple enough: learn how to invest, avoid bankruptcy, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014fall in love with one of the academy\u2019s eccentric (and dangerously unstable) high-profile bachelors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the cast:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/extras/8d4595f68dc9ab8991c157a9a7a6cfb7.avif?t=1760002422\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Broken (Protagonist)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cMake Oil Baby great again!\u201d<br>Our heroine. A girl who once dug up oil in her backyard, skyrocketed to wealth, and spiraled into disastrous financial choices. Now forced into the Academy to learn how not to burn through family fortunes. Her story lies somewhere between financial freedom and complete delusion (or maybe that\u2019s just the smell of oil).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/extras/bd9152beebef9354d4bb81d4558d6873.avif?t=1760002422\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oil Baby was the cosmetics brand she founded, aimed at high-income customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with the highest standards\u2014even the bottle caps were made of gold. And well\u2026 now you know the reason she went bankrupt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/extras/2e705f086f430bb10fcdf15cb03c3a77.avif?t=1760002422\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manil</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA\uff1a\u6885\u3053\u3076\u3057</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHmm? What\u2019s with that dazed look, dear student?\u201d<br>A refined linguistics teacher and fund CEO. Mature, eloquent, endlessly charismatic\u2026 and sometimes oddly unpredictable. He has such commanding presence that you\u2019d swear he\u2019s the headmaster (spoiler: he\u2019s not).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/extras/339ff2581e5601c20f0cd894430e949f.avif?t=1760002422\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Karlsai</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA\uff1a\u4e03\u8349\u79cb\u4eba</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cW-Woman! Why are you staring at me? Don\u2019t tell me\u2026 you\u2019ve fallen in love with me!?\u201d<br>The son of a real estate tycoon. Calls himself \u201core-sama,\u201d max-level tsundere, and utterly hopeless around women. To him, Broken is his first female friend\u2014if you don\u2019t count his mom and maids (which he insists you shouldn\u2019t).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/extras/74bb41f08e64157d4829c44874bfc3c3.avif?t=1760002422\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lancelot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA\uff1a\u6960\u6728\u307e\u308c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cMy lady, if you don\u2019t spend this million, don\u2019t bother going home.\u201d<br>The Academy\u2019s founder and current headmaster. The ultimate domineering CEO type. Obsessed with building muscle\u2014especially pecs\u2014he\u2019s infamous for teaching in a naked apron and punishing wrong answers with his \u201cmuscular wrath.\u201d Rumors say he and his sister (who runs a language school) are secretly the \u201ctwin pillars of the market.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda Game Details\u00a0<br>Genre: Visual Novel</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013450?t=1760002422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013450?t=1760002422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/ddfcd4b704253e2f4425a20a2b8e12b40f5980c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760002422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013450/ddfcd4b704253e2f4425a20a2b8e12b40f5980c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760002422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Mild foul words,\r\nMild sexual harassment,\r\nRevealing clothing"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-driven romance simulation, you\u2019ll play as Broken \u2014 a rich girl who struck oil in her own backyard and stumbled into sudden wealth, only to be sent to a prestigious Finance Academy after spectacular investment failures and a complete meltdown of her money sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission?<br>Simple enough: learn how to invest, avoid bankruptcy, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014fall in love with one of the academy\u2019s eccentric (and dangerously unstable) high-profile bachelors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the cast:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto